OL,3,GNEWSA'Dishonest' police officers sacked
OL,4,Afor lying over fatal crash searches    
OL,6,FTwo officers who lied about carrying   
OL,7,Fout missing person searches linked to a
OL,8,Fcrash in which three people died have  
OL,9,Fbeen sacked after being found guilty at
OL,10,Fa police misconduct hearing.           
OL,12,FPC Richard Hardwick and PC Lauren      
OL,13,FLivingstone faced gross misconduct     
OL,14,Fallegations over their actions before a
OL,15,Fcar carrying five people was found     
OL,16,Fcrashed two days later in St Mellons,  
OL,17,FCardiff, in 2023.                      
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
