OL,3,GNEWSA'Dishonest' police officers sacked
OL,4,Afor lying over fatal crash searches    
OL,6,FThe hearing in Newport was told they   
OL,7,Fwere "dishonest" in official logs and  
OL,8,Fto a senior officer by claiming        
OL,9,Fsearches of the homes of Eve Smith, who
OL,10,Fdied, and Sophie Russon had been       
OL,11,Fcarried out.                           
OL,13,FMembers of Smith's family described the
OL,14,Fverdict as "an important step towards  
OL,15,Faccountability".                       
